# Mutual exclusion history (Negation + Since + Conjunction)
#
# "idle and scanning were never simultaneously true in any global state"
#
# In a multi-drone system, one drone can be at idle (phase 0) while
# another is at scanning (phase 1). If their maximal events coexist
# in any frontier, both propositions appear in the global state.
# Whether this co-occurrence happens depends on the linearization.
!(TRUE S (idle & scanning))
